{"uuid": "fa036c27-2234-4f76-8857-c242530627ce", "variant": "base", "mode": "judged", "verdict": "pass", "notes": "Sampled (D21, SHA-256 first byte 0x14) and new prompt kind (voidRoute). As player, desktop and mobile (judged-god: God of the Veil in play, void Lab Sentry 2●, Lab Veteran 3●, Lab Revenant 1● with Reclaim, the opponent's void holding a 2● character, 5●): the player's void pile carries the playable ring and the opponent's never does; the void chooser offers exactly Play Lab Sentry, Play Lab Revenant, View Your Void and Cancel, all in the viewport; the void browser rings exactly the two ≤2● characters, not the 3● one. Playing Lab Revenant raises the voidRoute prompt (Pay Its Cost / Reclaim, both legal, in the viewport); a reload mid-prompt restores it; Pay Its Cost plays it for 1● (energy 5→4), not reclaimed (reclaimed and playedViaReclaim false), and the pile stays ringed for Lab Sentry; __caps empty.", "screens": ["god-board-desktop.png", "god-board-mobile.png", "god-chooser-desktop.png", "god-chooser-mobile.png", "god-browser-desktop.png", "god-browser-mobile.png", "god-route-desktop.png", "god-route-mobile.png", "god-route-reload-desktop.png", "god-route-reload-mobile.png", "god-played-desktop.png", "god-played-mobile.png", "god-log-desktop.png", "god-log-mobile.png"], "bead": "hv-umm2.81", "commit": "652cc1b4eb4f9f25d203227a78eb7ff57eab4f27"}
{"uuid": "fa036c27-2234-4f76-8857-c242530627ce", "variant": "base", "as": "enemy", "mode": "judged", "verdict": "pass", "notes": "As enemy, desktop and mobile (judged-enemy --arg card=god: God of the Veil and a 2● character in the opponent's void, 6●). The lab's AI worker fails every decision with a pre-existing duplicate-UUID catalog error and falls back to Random (docs/plan/evidence/pre-existing/hv-umm2.81.md), so the opponent's void play was scripted with the lab's enemyScript: the character moved from the opponent's void into play. The human's view never ringed the opponent's void pile over six turns, and the log reads the opponent's moves; __caps empty.", "screens": ["god-enemy-desktop.png", "god-enemy-mobile.png", "god-enemy-log-desktop.png", "god-enemy-log-mobile.png"], "bead": "hv-umm2.81", "commit": "652cc1b4eb4f9f25d203227a78eb7ff57eab4f27"}
{"uuid": "6f1833a0-30f5-4718-9a3e-7620beb72bfc", "variant": "base", "mode": "judged", "verdict": "pass", "notes": "Sampled (D21, SHA-256 first byte 0x0a) and new status (a play permission naming a card). As player, desktop and mobile (judged-salvager: Clockwork Salvager in play, hand Lab Sifting and Lab Sentry, void Lab Veteran, 4●): Lab Sifting draws 2 and its discard prompt discards Lab Sentry; the trigger gives it a play permission until end of turn: the void pile is ringed (the opponent's is not), and in the void browser Lab Sentry carries the playable ring and one duration badge inside its tile (Can be played from the void until end of turn), Lab Veteran neither; the battle log reads the permission line; a reload keeps ring and badge. Playing it from the void costs its normal 2● (energy 3→1) and it enters play, not reclaimed; __caps empty.", "screens": ["salvager-browser-desktop.png", "salvager-browser-mobile.png", "salvager-pile-desktop.png", "salvager-pile-mobile.png", "salvager-log-desktop.png", "salvager-log-mobile.png", "salvager-reload-browser-desktop.png", "salvager-reload-browser-mobile.png", "salvager-played-desktop.png", "salvager-played-mobile.png"], "bead": "hv-umm2.81", "commit": "652cc1b4eb4f9f25d203227a78eb7ff57eab4f27"}
{"uuid": "6f1833a0-30f5-4718-9a3e-7620beb72bfc", "variant": "base", "as": "enemy", "mode": "judged", "verdict": "pass", "notes": "As enemy, desktop and mobile (judged-enemy --arg card=salvager: Clockwork Salvager, hand Lab Sifting and Lab Sentry, 1●, Lab Sifting played by the lab's enemyScript since the lab AI falls back to Random): the opponent discards Lab Sentry and the log reads its permission line; the opponent's void browser shows Lab Sentry with the one duration badge and no ring, no opponent tile or pile is ever ringed; __caps empty.", "screens": ["salvager-enemy-browser-desktop.png", "salvager-enemy-browser-mobile.png", "salvager-enemy-desktop.png", "salvager-enemy-mobile.png", "salvager-enemy-log-desktop.png", "salvager-enemy-log-mobile.png"], "bead": "hv-umm2.81", "commit": "652cc1b4eb4f9f25d203227a78eb7ff57eab4f27"}
{"uuid": "cd3d8e4a-618e-4c2f-be60-0363b81887f1", "variant": "base", "mode": "judged", "verdict": "pass", "notes": "New status (a one-play permission on the player's side). As player, desktop and mobile (judged-echo: Echo Technician in play, void an event (1●) and Lab Sentry, 3●): the ☾ activation gives the permission: one new duration badge by the player's status display, in the viewport (May play one event from the void), the void pile ringed, the chooser offering one play plus View Your Void and Cancel, and the browser ringing only the event; the log reads 'You may play one event from your void.'; a reload keeps badge and ring. Playing the event from the void costs 1● (energy 3→2), it resolves into the void, not reclaimed, and the badge and pile ring go; __caps empty.", "screens": ["echo-browser-desktop.png", "echo-browser-mobile.png", "echo-status-desktop.png", "echo-status-mobile.png", "echo-log-desktop.png", "echo-log-mobile.png", "echo-used-desktop.png", "echo-used-mobile.png"], "bead": "hv-umm2.81", "commit": "652cc1b4eb4f9f25d203227a78eb7ff57eab4f27"}
{"uuid": "cd3d8e4a-618e-4c2f-be60-0363b81887f1", "variant": "base", "as": "enemy", "mode": "judged", "verdict": "pass", "notes": "As enemy, desktop and mobile (judged-enemy --arg card=echo: Echo Technician and an event in the opponent's void, 6●; the lab AI's Random fallback activated it): the opponent's status shows the one-play permission badge, the log reads 'Your opponent may play one event from their void.' and then the opponent's play of the event, and the opponent's void pile is never ringed; __caps empty.", "screens": ["echo-enemy-desktop.png", "echo-enemy-mobile.png", "echo-enemy-log-desktop.png", "echo-enemy-log-mobile.png"], "bead": "hv-umm2.81", "commit": "652cc1b4eb4f9f25d203227a78eb7ff57eab4f27"}
